WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00.010 --> 00:01.520
[Disclaimer: All events depicted in this series are fictional]

3
00:01.540 --> 00:02.350
[and created for entertainment purposes only.]

4
00:02.370 --> 00:03.260
[Viewer discretion is advised.]

5
00:21.990 --> 00:26.910
[Ubon Ratchathani, 2027]

6
00:46.280 --> 00:47.990
If anything feels unsafe,

7
00:48.250 --> 00:49.840
just get out of there right away.

8
00:50.150 --> 00:51.990
It's just a regular abandoned building.

9
00:53.000 --> 00:54.360
Nothing to be afraid of.

10
00:56.070 --> 00:56.900
Well...

11
00:57.720 --> 00:59.430
are there any vengeful spirits?

12
01:09.940 --> 01:10.710
Just a few.

13
01:11.400 --> 01:12.460
I heard that

14
01:12.610 --> 01:13.940
the owner is renovating it

15
01:13.960 --> 01:15.289
into a community health center.

16
01:15.590 --> 01:16.860
If so,

17
01:17.500 --> 01:19.320
please pass along my blessings as well.

18
01:19.350 --> 01:20.110
[Peem]

19
01:20.140 --> 01:22.539
Sure. I'll finish up the ritual

20
01:22.570 --> 01:23.840
and be right back.

21
01:25.230 --> 01:26.750
Take your time, Peem.

22
01:27.160 --> 01:28.620
Your safety matters more than anything.

23
01:29.630 --> 01:32.250
Then I'll miss out on your cooking.

24
01:35.000 --> 01:36.060
In that case...

25
01:37.250 --> 01:38.420
hurry back, okay?

26
01:38.640 --> 01:41.200
I'll get dinner ready and wait for you at our home.

27
01:43.289 --> 01:43.950
Alright.

28
01:45.440 --> 01:46.900
See you at our home.

29
01:47.100 --> 01:47.840
See you.

30
02:08.229 --> 02:09.050
Thong.

31
02:10.130 --> 02:10.840
Ake.

32
02:11.770 --> 02:13.860
I'm getting married next month.

33
02:16.030 --> 02:17.860
Your master won't be lonely anymore.

34
02:18.120 --> 02:19.260
Don't you worry.

35
02:30.990 --> 02:31.770
Hello, Coach Dol.

36
02:31.790 --> 02:34.240
Khem, I just sent you the final episode script.

37
02:34.260 --> 02:34.850
Okay.

38
02:35.160 --> 02:37.000
I'll read it right away.

39
02:37.090 --> 02:38.160
Thank you.

40
02:38.410 --> 02:39.210
Will do.

41
02:40.190 --> 02:41.010
Okay.

42
03:14.680 --> 03:38.650
[Incanting]

43
03:43.940 --> 03:47.700
[Incanting]

44
03:47.730 --> 03:48.670
Is it done yet?

45
03:50.110 --> 03:51.329
Like I'd know, Auntie.

46
03:52.590 --> 03:53.840
If you don't know, then go check.

47
03:53.870 --> 03:55.320
And I'm not an auntie.

48
03:56.030 --> 03:57.260
Yeah, but a Karen.

49
03:58.220 --> 03:59.710
Go check. Now.

50
04:00.870 --> 04:01.560
Just go.

51
04:03.650 --> 04:04.310
Hurry.

52
04:10.750 --> 04:12.060
You done yet, bro?

53
04:17.250 --> 04:18.760
Why did you come in here?

54
04:19.040 --> 04:20.890
I'm going to help you pack.

55
04:58.159 --> 05:04.250
♪ A blessed day has come, with fortune aglow ♪

56
05:04.270 --> 05:10.320
♪ Graceful offerings are arranged in a row ♪

57
05:10.340 --> 05:14.570
♪ Sacred threads and rings of gold, ♪

58
05:14.590 --> 05:17.470
♪ Jewels and necklaces, precious to behold ♪

59
05:17.490 --> 05:19.710
♪ A feast overflowing with plenty to spare ♪

60
05:19.740 --> 05:22.550
♪ All things prepared with the greatest care ♪

61
05:22.580 --> 05:25.120
♪ Betel rolls and areca nuts are laid there ♪

62
05:25.140 --> 05:28.120
♪ Everything adorned and displayed with flair ♪

63
05:28.140 --> 05:34.190
♪ "May your vital forces come forth" ♪

64
05:34.210 --> 05:38.320
♪ May your vital forces come forth ♪

65
05:38.960 --> 05:42.600
♪ O vital forces, beyond the skies, ♪

66
05:42.630 --> 05:44.840
♪ In distant realms where your souls fly, ♪

67
05:44.860 --> 05:46.659
♪ Heed the call and now arise, ♪

68
05:46.680 --> 05:53.490
♪ Return to where your vessels lie ♪

69
06:34.750 --> 06:35.940
I'm here, babe.

70
06:38.400 --> 06:39.590
Walk straight on in.

71
06:44.050 --> 06:44.740
What?

72
07:03.070 --> 07:04.670
- It's a test - It's a test

73
07:04.690 --> 07:06.690
- of your sixth sense. - of your sixth sense.

74
07:07.480 --> 07:08.860
- Guess - Guess

75
07:08.890 --> 07:10.230
- which one of us - which one of us

76
07:10.250 --> 07:12.180
- is your boyfriend. - is your boyfriend.

77
07:13.540 --> 07:14.920
I don't need any sixth sense for this.

78
07:30.130 --> 07:31.880
I know every inch of you, Jet.

79
07:32.820 --> 07:34.280
I can tell with just my heart.

80
08:00.220 --> 08:01.020
Hey.

81
08:02.280 --> 08:03.200
Take it easy.

82
08:04.330 --> 08:05.860
We're not alone, you know.

83
08:08.960 --> 08:09.690
Alright.

84
08:10.300 --> 08:11.630
Thank you so much, everyone.

85
08:11.650 --> 08:13.340
You can all get back to work now.

86
08:15.510 --> 08:16.860
What's with that smile?

87
08:16.920 --> 08:18.140
The durian looks amazing.

88
08:19.440 --> 08:20.190
Let's head inside.

89
08:20.260 --> 08:20.880
Okay.

90
08:21.740 --> 08:23.110
Jet and Charn

91
08:23.130 --> 08:25.380
are both an essential part of this story.

92
08:25.980 --> 08:27.470
They're friends who have sacrificed so much

93
08:28.050 --> 08:31.010
and braved countless dangers for me unconditionally.

94
08:32.289 --> 08:32.950
Come on.

95
08:34.440 --> 08:35.260
Whoa.

96
08:41.340 --> 08:42.190
Look.

97
08:42.640 --> 08:43.500
We're here.

98
08:45.310 --> 08:48.130
Welcome to my orchard home,

99
08:48.570 --> 08:49.550
bae.

100
08:53.840 --> 08:55.810
Though the two seem like polar opposites...

101
08:55.830 --> 08:56.780
Let's go inside.

102
08:57.200 --> 08:59.270
- They complement each other perfectly, - Let's go.

103
08:59.760 --> 09:01.990
and that's how their love blossomed.

104
09:02.020 --> 09:06.200
[Grandpa Phaew's Durian Orchard]

105
09:12.840 --> 09:14.510
As for Master Paran,

106
09:14.540 --> 09:16.700
on the outside, he may appear stern,

107
09:16.730 --> 09:18.760
cold, and indifferent to anyone...

108
09:18.820 --> 09:20.910
I know you spirits are still conscious.

109
09:24.050 --> 09:27.040
Do not let vengeance consume your souls.

110
09:35.120 --> 09:36.900
You have lingered here for so long

111
09:38.060 --> 09:40.210
that you have forgotten who you truly are.

112
09:42.570 --> 09:44.140
Yet in truth, it is Master

113
09:44.540 --> 09:46.870
who cares the most deeply for everyone around him.

114
09:47.300 --> 09:49.360
Let me set you free.

115
09:56.120 --> 10:03.740
[Incanting]

116
10:04.160 --> 10:05.620
May you pass on to a peaceful realm.

117
10:06.550 --> 10:08.530
May every life and every soul

118
10:08.550 --> 10:10.730
imprisoned in this place

119
10:11.650 --> 10:15.380
be reborn into a blessed realm.

120
10:18.090 --> 10:21.160
His back bears the weight of everything all the time.

121
10:21.980 --> 10:23.700
He wants every struggle

122
10:23.950 --> 10:26.760
to end with as little heartbreak as possible

123
10:28.710 --> 10:30.440
without ever caring

124
10:30.790 --> 10:33.500
how much pain he inflicts upon himself.

125
10:40.080 --> 10:41.220
That is why,

126
10:41.380 --> 10:44.230
no matter how stern he appears on the outside...

127
10:45.980 --> 10:48.100
May you pass on to a peaceful realm.

128
10:49.410 --> 10:51.200
Let your karma guide your path now.

129
10:51.370 --> 10:53.120
There's always a hint of vulnerability

130
10:53.540 --> 10:56.510
in his eyes that makes your heart ache.

131
11:02.240 --> 11:03.590
Now that you're done helping the ghosts,

132
11:03.730 --> 11:04.840
help your friend too, damn it.

133
11:11.320 --> 11:12.670
Hurry up, it hurts.

134
11:27.870 --> 11:28.920
I think

135
11:29.220 --> 11:31.490
if we can preserve the essence of the characters,

136
11:32.310 --> 11:34.350
the audience is bound to love them.

137
11:35.260 --> 11:37.610
And if we need to adapt things for the series,

138
11:38.260 --> 11:39.950
I'm sure the audience will understand.

139
11:39.980 --> 11:42.600
Okay, thank you so much, Khem.

140
11:43.420 --> 11:47.320
By the way, when's your wedding with Master?

141
11:50.780 --> 11:53.350
Probably early next year, Coach Dol.

142
11:53.410 --> 11:55.290
Oh, so it's just around the corner.

143
11:55.310 --> 11:56.610
Congratulations.

144
11:57.970 --> 11:59.120
Thank you so much.

145
11:59.750 --> 12:02.680
I hope everything goes smoothly on set.

146
12:02.950 --> 12:05.850
Alright, I'll call again if I need more advice.

147
12:06.130 --> 12:07.710
Sure. Goodbye.

148
12:07.740 --> 12:09.310
Thank you.

149
13:21.630 --> 13:23.370
I missed you so much, Peem.

150
13:24.410 --> 13:25.840
I've barely been gone a day.

151
13:25.860 --> 13:26.920
You missed me already?

152
13:34.130 --> 13:36.010
Yeah, you're so dramatic.

153
13:36.490 --> 13:37.740
Don't you miss me at all?

154
13:40.700 --> 13:41.960
Jet, Charn!

155
13:44.530 --> 13:46.350
It's been so long.

156
13:51.290 --> 13:52.980
[Only for someone special]

157
13:57.590 --> 14:00.010
Whoa, Master's place

158
14:00.040 --> 14:01.670
is now tightly fenced in and secured.

159
14:01.820 --> 14:04.660
Well, it's because of that break-in last time.

160
14:04.690 --> 14:06.420
Oh, back when we went back for our final year,

161
14:06.440 --> 14:08.770
and someone was hitting on you?

162
14:08.850 --> 14:10.670
Master even left his house

163
14:10.700 --> 14:12.100
just to be with you because he was jealous.

164
14:12.400 --> 14:14.050
Did that really call for building a whole fence?

165
14:16.670 --> 14:17.770
No need to rub it in.

166
14:21.280 --> 14:22.150
Let's just head inside.

167
14:23.630 --> 14:24.640
Or you'll end up leaving late.

168
14:31.160 --> 14:33.060
Come on, let's head inside.

169
14:33.640 --> 14:34.570
Wait a second.

170
14:35.450 --> 14:37.630
Why did you guys buy so much stuff?

171
14:37.650 --> 14:38.300
- I went all out. - Look!

172
14:38.320 --> 14:40.360
Here, check this out.

173
14:46.450 --> 14:47.190
Whoa!

174
14:48.440 --> 14:50.250
Did you embroider this yourself, Khem?

175
14:50.650 --> 14:51.590
Thanks a lot.

176
14:51.920 --> 14:52.710
Yeah.

177
14:52.830 --> 14:54.840
Master even put an amulet inside.

178
14:55.150 --> 14:56.380
- Open it up. - Really?

179
14:59.540 --> 15:00.690
- How is it? - Whoa.

180
15:03.240 --> 15:04.350
An inn-khu.

181
15:05.500 --> 15:07.500
It carries sacred blessings

182
15:07.800 --> 15:09.660
that will keep your love strong for years to come.

183
15:10.890 --> 15:13.360
No matter what you have to face,

184
15:13.750 --> 15:15.630
you must hold hands and get through it together.

185
15:35.900 --> 15:36.540
What?

186
15:40.290 --> 15:41.040
Khem...

187
15:43.830 --> 15:44.700
What is this?

188
15:45.130 --> 15:46.040
Check it out.

189
15:47.540 --> 15:48.840
Is it a gift?

190
15:52.600 --> 15:53.730
Whoa.

191
15:53.870 --> 15:55.340
So cute!

192
15:58.150 --> 16:00.250
You're giving me two of them?

193
16:00.860 --> 16:02.350
It's so you can wear them with Master.

194
16:02.370 --> 16:03.520
They're adorable.

195
16:07.170 --> 16:09.060
If you put them on, send me a picture.

196
16:09.630 --> 16:10.320
Okay.

197
16:13.670 --> 16:14.630
Aren't they cute?

198
16:26.060 --> 16:27.990
There's more?

199
16:29.210 --> 16:31.110
Oh, I guess it comes as a set.

200
16:39.430 --> 16:43.690
Well, since marriage is all about starting a family...

201
16:44.100 --> 16:45.110
As for their future,

202
16:45.360 --> 16:47.580
I think it's best to let them decide for themselves.

203
16:50.030 --> 16:51.020
Sorry about that.

204
16:51.470 --> 16:53.630
Was I being rude?

205
17:00.190 --> 17:01.150
Don't overthink it.

206
17:01.530 --> 17:02.130
Come on.

207
17:02.680 --> 17:03.760
Let's just eat.

208
17:04.740 --> 17:05.650
Come on.

209
17:05.670 --> 17:07.060
- Okay. - Let's dig in.

210
17:08.480 --> 17:09.760
- Hey. - Come on.

211
17:09.780 --> 17:11.349
Let's have a toast.

212
17:13.780 --> 17:14.740
Three, two, one...

213
17:14.760 --> 17:16.550
- Cheers! - Cheers!

214
17:16.579 --> 17:18.000
Whoa.

215
17:28.300 --> 17:32.930
Did they make the bottle's mouth wider?

216
17:33.110 --> 17:34.490
- Yeah. - Right?

217
17:34.510 --> 17:37.000
It makes the drink smell better, Jet.

218
17:37.130 --> 17:37.980
Totally.

219
17:51.670 --> 17:52.700
Whoa...

220
17:54.490 --> 17:55.470
What?

221
17:55.900 --> 17:57.790
Your cheeks smell better, too.

222
17:58.970 --> 17:59.860
Charn!

223
18:05.490 --> 18:09.350
- Open wide. - Ah...

224
18:10.460 --> 18:11.610
Eat up

225
18:11.630 --> 18:13.090
so you'll have plenty of energy for tonight.

226
18:13.870 --> 18:14.650
Charn!

227
18:19.000 --> 18:20.340
Look at Khem.

228
18:20.670 --> 18:22.550
His mouth is open wider than the bottle now!

229
18:24.370 --> 18:25.940
- Let's just eat. - Come on.

230
18:25.970 --> 18:27.870
You're gonna give yourself cancer. It's charred!

231
18:27.890 --> 18:28.930
Just eat up.

232
18:29.020 --> 18:30.240
Eat some fiber, too.

233
18:34.090 --> 18:35.140
You want me to feed you?

234
18:57.740 --> 18:58.930
Did they get home already?

235
19:12.850 --> 19:13.930
What are you doing?

236
19:15.170 --> 19:16.770
I just want to recharge on you.

237
19:20.020 --> 19:22.100
I haven't gotten to since I got back.

238
19:28.100 --> 19:29.400
If you recharge too much,

239
19:30.390 --> 19:31.710
you might lose control.

240
19:57.430 --> 19:58.620
Hang in there a little longer.

241
20:00.400 --> 20:01.740
Once we finally tie the knot

242
20:03.350 --> 20:04.540
and become family,

243
20:05.720 --> 20:07.240
we'll get to share a room.

244
20:12.310 --> 20:13.720
Are you telling me that?

245
20:15.720 --> 20:16.890
I'm telling myself.

246
20:22.610 --> 20:24.220
If it weren't for the auspicious date,

247
20:24.940 --> 20:27.580
I'd carry you off to register our marriage right now.

248
20:30.170 --> 20:32.430
That way, you could take my last name.

249
20:43.360 --> 20:44.800
Your last name?

250
20:47.780 --> 20:48.650
Why?

251
20:50.180 --> 20:51.470
Is something wrong?

252
20:54.850 --> 20:55.710
No.

253
20:58.410 --> 20:59.440
I just...

254
21:00.220 --> 21:02.380
completely forgot to even think about the surname.

255
21:02.630 --> 21:04.040
You don't want to change it?

256
21:06.880 --> 21:07.990
I'm sorry.

257
21:10.330 --> 21:12.500
Whichever last name you want to use,

258
21:13.510 --> 21:15.270
it's totally up to you.

259
21:22.990 --> 21:24.020
Are you mad at me?

260
21:27.230 --> 21:28.250
I'm not.

261
21:29.250 --> 21:30.110
It's just that...

262
21:31.150 --> 21:33.460
I really hadn't thought about this at all.

263
21:36.730 --> 21:39.070
The reason I've always kept my mom's surname

264
21:40.710 --> 21:44.290
is to keep the curse confined within our bloodline

265
21:46.280 --> 21:50.230
and prevent it from spreading to another family.

266
21:52.700 --> 21:54.640
You're worried that if you change it,

267
21:55.000 --> 21:57.440
Auntie Khaekhai's family name will be lost, right?

268
22:14.000 --> 22:15.680
Take all the time you need.

269
22:17.590 --> 22:18.760
We still have time.

270
22:28.170 --> 22:28.830
Wait...

271
22:30.160 --> 22:32.560
We were talking so much we missed the countdown.

272
22:34.130 --> 22:36.670
Happy New Year, Peem.

273
22:41.390 --> 22:42.850
Happy New Year, Khem.

274
22:45.030 --> 22:46.850
Let's stay together for a long, long time.

275
23:05.450 --> 23:06.140
Uh...

276
23:06.860 --> 23:08.140
Want to watch the fireworks?

277
23:11.840 --> 23:12.700
Whoa.

278
23:14.950 --> 23:15.890
So pretty.

279
23:18.550 --> 23:20.430
It's so beautiful, Peem.

280
23:27.420 --> 23:33.840
♪ Our love is still right here to stay, ♪

281
23:33.870 --> 23:40.320
♪ It never left, never went away ♪

282
23:40.340 --> 23:46.600
♪ Though it was hard to get through yesterday, ♪

283
23:46.630 --> 23:53.120
♪ The sky looks bright again today ♪

284
24:15.200 --> 24:16.080
That's enough.

285
25:03.390 --> 25:05.210
Putting in quite a workout to start the year, huh?

286
25:07.030 --> 25:08.430
Happy New Year,

287
25:08.720 --> 25:09.630
babe.

288
25:13.650 --> 25:15.090
Happy New Year,

289
25:15.610 --> 25:16.630
bae.

290
25:59.220 --> 26:01.050
You've only been here for a few days, leaving already?

291
26:02.170 --> 26:03.510
Can't you stay a little longer?

292
26:03.990 --> 26:05.060
With you here,

293
26:05.080 --> 26:07.340
my boss looks so much brighter.

294
26:09.140 --> 26:11.790
What do I look like when he's not around?

295
26:13.980 --> 26:14.920
Excuse me, then.

296
26:14.950 --> 26:16.010
Thank you.

297
26:23.320 --> 26:25.260
He's got a point, though.

298
26:25.630 --> 26:27.460
I'm so much happier when you're around.

299
26:29.540 --> 26:30.870
Can't you just stay?

300
26:34.110 --> 26:36.000
I still have a mountain of work at the hotel.

301
26:37.940 --> 26:38.960
Wait for me, okay?

302
26:39.320 --> 26:41.130
I'll be back for Khem's wedding anyway.

303
26:45.200 --> 26:45.830
Let's go.

304
27:03.310 --> 27:03.930
Mom?

305
27:04.840 --> 27:05.930
Hello.

306
27:14.110 --> 27:15.050
Come on, Mom.

307
27:15.810 --> 27:17.660
I was about to bring Charn over to see you.

308
27:17.860 --> 27:19.350
You didn't have to come all the way here.

309
27:29.780 --> 27:30.880
This one is ripe.

310
27:42.000 --> 27:43.310
This one isn't ripe yet.

311
27:43.330 --> 27:44.490
This one's ripe, too.

312
27:51.240 --> 27:53.440
Whoa, this one is too ripe.

313
27:53.650 --> 27:56.630
Actually, we've already sorted out the mature ones.

314
28:00.690 --> 28:02.390
Gosh, Jet...

315
28:02.960 --> 28:04.350
Will you ever get the hang of this?

316
28:04.700 --> 28:06.930
You can't even tell ripe from unripe.

317
28:06.950 --> 28:09.430
Come on, Mom, give me some time.

318
28:09.450 --> 28:11.440
Can you stop using your teacher mode on your son?

319
28:11.800 --> 28:12.490
What?

320
28:18.660 --> 28:19.410
Mom,

321
28:19.520 --> 28:21.830
Jet is really dedicated to the work.

322
28:22.020 --> 28:23.120
He might not know what he's doing,

323
28:23.140 --> 28:25.060
but he's putting his whole heart into it.

324
28:25.650 --> 28:26.470
Charn!

325
28:26.930 --> 28:28.070
Do you actually want to help me?

326
28:28.840 --> 28:30.110
Of course I do.

327
28:32.290 --> 28:33.070
Yes.

328
28:37.040 --> 28:38.490
Oh, Charn.

329
28:38.520 --> 28:39.140
Yes?

330
28:39.160 --> 28:40.920
Didn't you bring my mom a gift?

331
28:42.080 --> 28:43.200
I'll go grab it for you.

332
28:47.180 --> 28:49.700
It's probably a Chinese New Year gift.

333
28:50.810 --> 28:52.470
A Valentine's gift, Mom.

334
28:52.490 --> 28:53.170
Uh...

335
28:55.480 --> 28:56.270
Mom,

336
28:56.420 --> 28:58.590
get to know your future son-in-law while I'm gone.

337
28:58.870 --> 29:00.050
Love you, Mom. Muah!

338
29:00.070 --> 29:00.880
[J3T Ubon Ratchathani 108]

339
29:02.470 --> 29:03.730
Jet!

340
29:06.410 --> 29:07.200
He's gone.

341
29:07.230 --> 29:08.010
He...

342
29:08.090 --> 29:08.930
just left us.

343
29:13.580 --> 29:16.140
Happy belated New Year, Mom.

344
29:16.820 --> 29:17.730
This one's ripe, by the way.

345
29:33.270 --> 29:34.100
Mint.

346
29:40.900 --> 29:42.150
Praemai.

347
29:48.030 --> 29:49.140
Peem?

348
29:52.790 --> 29:53.850
The wedding invites you're having Charn

349
29:53.870 --> 29:55.380
hand out to your friends in Bangkok, right?

350
29:56.660 --> 29:57.300
Yes.

351
29:59.750 --> 30:01.700
Actually, everyone's already said they'd come,

352
30:02.520 --> 30:04.430
but since the artwork turned out so gorgeous,

353
30:05.070 --> 30:06.850
I wanted them to have the actual cards, too.

354
30:08.250 --> 30:08.810
You know...

355
30:09.630 --> 30:11.380
it's pretty rare to see

356
30:11.630 --> 30:13.130
a smile like that on your face.

357
30:29.170 --> 30:31.150
I save it just for you.

358
31:01.450 --> 31:04.860
Khwankhao, Phet and Uea's daughter,

359
31:05.380 --> 31:07.470
took her friends from Bangkok trekking in the forest

360
31:07.700 --> 31:08.980
right before New Year's.

361
31:15.370 --> 31:16.390
Then Pond,

362
31:16.690 --> 31:17.840
Baitong's husband,

363
31:18.800 --> 31:20.200
volunteered to pick them up

364
31:20.870 --> 31:23.430
but went missing along with all of them.

365
31:26.660 --> 31:28.950
Aren't the police already searching for them?

366
31:33.340 --> 31:34.510
They are, Master,

367
31:35.000 --> 31:36.700
but it's been three days now.

368
31:37.140 --> 31:38.420
Still no sign of them.

369
31:39.130 --> 31:41.600
Khwankhao knows sorcery herself.

370
31:42.190 --> 31:43.780
For things to have turned out like this,

371
31:44.010 --> 31:45.910
that forest must be no ordinary place.

372
31:46.740 --> 31:48.060
The occult forces must be powerful.

373
31:50.390 --> 31:51.110
Master,

374
31:52.320 --> 31:54.220
please help my daughter.

375
31:54.590 --> 31:56.590
I'll do whatever it takes to repay you.

376
31:57.060 --> 31:59.030
Please save her, Master.

377
32:00.930 --> 32:03.070
Whether dead or alive,

378
32:03.280 --> 32:07.240
please let me see her face again.

379
32:09.630 --> 32:12.110
Please help me, Master.

380
32:16.550 --> 32:18.020
I'm sorry.

381
32:20.860 --> 32:22.470
But you should prepare yourselves for the worst.

382
32:26.290 --> 32:27.600
It's already been three days.

383
32:29.990 --> 32:31.800
There's likely not much I can do.

384
32:33.850 --> 32:35.950
How are you doing, sweetie?

385
32:39.120 --> 32:40.480
Pond...

386
32:43.830 --> 32:45.330
Master, please help them.

387
32:50.150 --> 32:51.300
But...

388
32:51.460 --> 32:52.660
At least give it a try.

389
32:54.210 --> 32:56.190
I want you to help everyone here,

390
32:57.490 --> 32:58.900
just like you once helped me.

391
33:04.970 --> 33:07.120
Please, Master.

392
33:07.350 --> 33:09.840
- Please help us. - We have nowhere else to turn.

393
33:09.870 --> 33:11.680
Master, please help them.

394
34:03.550 --> 34:05.120
I'll be back as soon as I can.

395
34:06.760 --> 34:07.380
Okay.

396
34:27.469 --> 34:28.400
You should go.

397
34:39.570 --> 34:44.820
[KJ 1726 Ubon Ratchathani]

398
34:57.640 --> 34:58.270
Oh?

399
35:01.100 --> 35:03.660
Whoa, Master is performing exorcisms to start the year?

400
35:04.980 --> 35:05.950
Kind of.

401
35:06.170 --> 35:08.170
But why did you ride a motorbike here?

402
35:08.710 --> 35:09.510
Where's Charn?

403
35:12.840 --> 35:14.480
He'll be right behind me.

404
35:17.480 --> 35:18.460
I'm starving.

405
35:18.550 --> 35:19.480
Got anything to eat?

406
35:20.300 --> 35:21.060
Sure do.

407
35:21.610 --> 35:23.270
There are pork sausages in the kitchen.

408
35:23.300 --> 35:26.140
Sweet! Pork sausages, here I come.

409
35:38.610 --> 35:39.490
Coach Dol?

410
35:44.510 --> 35:45.640
Hello, Coach Dol.

411
35:46.330 --> 35:48.000
Is there an issue with the script?

412
35:53.270 --> 35:54.010
What?

413
35:55.700 --> 35:56.950
The set was haunted,

414
35:56.980 --> 35:58.790
so you had to call off three days of shooting?

415
36:00.020 --> 36:00.780
So,

416
36:01.260 --> 36:03.050
did anyone else experience anything strange?

417
36:07.600 --> 36:10.240
In that case, I think it's likely a vengeful spirit.

418
36:11.360 --> 36:12.370
My advice is

419
36:12.480 --> 36:14.640
to postpone the shoot for now.

420
36:15.200 --> 36:16.620
You won't make the air date?

421
36:19.280 --> 36:21.350
You want Master to exorcise the ghosts?

422
36:21.950 --> 36:22.740
Well...

423
36:24.100 --> 36:26.270
he just left a moment ago.

424
36:31.410 --> 36:35.210
His disciples who could do it?

425
36:40.660 --> 36:43.170
Someone to stand in for him?

426
36:48.360 --> 36:50.590
Let's talk again later, then.

427
36:51.600 --> 36:52.430
Yes.

428
36:55.660 --> 36:57.070
Why did you hang up so fast?

429
36:58.470 --> 36:59.910
Why didn't you just say yes?

430
36:59.960 --> 37:01.300
He basically set the stage for me.

431
37:03.300 --> 37:04.900
This isn't a joke, Jet.

432
37:04.920 --> 37:05.720
Hey!

433
37:06.010 --> 37:07.260
I'm not joking, either.

434
37:07.280 --> 37:09.080
I'm Master's number-one disciple, you know.

435
37:09.400 --> 37:11.040
Come on, please.

436
37:11.340 --> 37:13.280
We can go bust ghosts together just like old times.

437
37:13.480 --> 37:15.370
Nobody's more vicious than Ramphueng anyway.

438
37:18.310 --> 37:19.050
Oh, and...

439
37:19.630 --> 37:20.430
that way,

440
37:20.740 --> 37:22.750
you can hand out the wedding invitations yourself.

441
37:22.780 --> 37:24.180
You won't have to trouble Charn.

442
37:28.440 --> 37:33.800
[GP 2543 Ubon Ratchathani]

443
37:34.230 --> 37:36.380
Why did you run away from your mom, Jet?

444
37:37.030 --> 37:37.760
Charn?

445
37:37.870 --> 37:38.580
Oh!

446
37:38.900 --> 37:39.700
Charn...

447
37:39.860 --> 37:42.350
Look, there's trouble on the set of Khem's series.

448
37:42.370 --> 37:43.860
They need Master's disciples to exorcise ghosts!

449
37:53.220 --> 37:54.230
Don't even think about it, Jet.

450
37:54.840 --> 37:57.170
Charn has to get back to work at the hotel soon.

451
38:04.490 --> 38:05.660
Hello, Mom.

452
38:08.910 --> 38:09.980
I'll be there a bit late.

453
38:14.810 --> 38:16.390
Where are they shooting the series?

454
38:17.190 --> 38:18.110
Where?

455
38:19.860 --> 38:20.840
Sing Buri.

456
38:22.990 --> 38:24.640
I have something to do in Sing Buri, Mom.

457
38:24.660 --> 38:26.430
I might be delayed by a day or two.

458
38:28.560 --> 38:29.710
No need to cancel the flight.

459
38:29.900 --> 38:32.920
Could you have your secretary book two more seats instead?

460
38:41.600 --> 38:42.930
Go get your stuff!

461
38:42.960 --> 38:43.790
The luggage, you know.

462
38:44.970 --> 38:46.280
And I have to...

463
38:53.460 --> 38:54.210
Yes!

464
38:57.900 --> 38:58.500
Let's go.

465
38:58.780 --> 39:00.600
Now I have to delay my return,

466
39:00.620 --> 39:02.050
rebook tickets,

467
39:02.070 --> 39:03.220
and I still have to...

468
39:03.240 --> 39:04.190
Eat up!

469
39:04.760 --> 39:05.910
Come on.

470
39:06.340 --> 39:07.220
Come on, Khem.

471
39:07.460 --> 39:08.490
Go take a shower and get ready.

472
39:13.750 --> 39:15.600
Don't let anything happen to any of you.

473
39:17.050 --> 39:18.010
Understood?

474
39:18.600 --> 39:21.920
Got it! I won't let even one mosquito get near Khem.

475
39:22.130 --> 39:23.680
Don't worry, Master.

476
39:23.790 --> 39:25.100
If things get dangerous,

477
39:25.140 --> 39:27.740
I'll get everyone out of there immediately.

478
39:27.760 --> 39:28.900
Yeah, that's right.

479
39:36.260 --> 39:36.970
I got it.

480
39:37.790 --> 39:39.880
Trouble right at the start of the year, huh?

481
39:40.460 --> 39:41.440
Tell me about it.

482
39:42.500 --> 39:44.380
I only left a few hours ago,

483
39:44.770 --> 39:46.810
and you're already running away from me.

484
39:48.850 --> 39:49.460
Well...

485
39:50.360 --> 39:52.800
think of it as doing a good deed before our wedding.

486
39:53.690 --> 39:55.670
I'm sure our wedding

487
39:55.700 --> 39:57.200
will go without a hitch.

488
39:59.410 --> 40:00.810
Wait for me, okay?

489
40:02.230 --> 40:04.330
I... will make it... back alive...

490
40:04.360 --> 40:05.040
Sorry?

491
40:06.220 --> 40:07.090
Hello?

492
40:09.080 --> 40:09.880
Hello?

493
40:12.490 --> 40:13.240
Hello?

494
40:13.260 --> 40:14.540
Hello, Peem?

495
40:14.750 --> 40:15.630
Peem?

496
40:15.750 --> 40:16.650
Hello?

497
40:16.860 --> 40:21.160
[KJ 1726 Ubon Ratchathani]

498
40:21.610 --> 40:22.440
Hello?

499
40:34.490 --> 40:36.220
What happened, Khem?

500
40:42.450 --> 40:43.750
He might...

501
40:44.350 --> 40:46.320
be in a dead zone, I guess.

502
40:47.050 --> 40:48.420
It's probably nothing.

503
40:48.630 --> 40:49.270
Right?

504
40:54.720 --> 40:55.620
This is great.

505
40:56.500 --> 40:58.670
We haven't all hung out together in ages.

506
40:59.570 --> 41:01.570
If you didn't run away from your mom,

507
41:01.800 --> 41:03.970
I doubt we'd be doing this at all.

508
41:04.210 --> 41:04.970
Hey!

509
41:05.510 --> 41:07.670
Don't kill the vibe like that, bae.

510
41:08.880 --> 41:09.670
Come on.

511
41:09.700 --> 41:11.620
Now, hands in.

512
41:13.070 --> 41:13.720
Okay.

513
41:15.090 --> 41:16.600
One, two, three!

514
41:23.630 --> 41:24.770
What are you laughing at?

515
41:25.850 --> 41:26.770
What's so funny?

516
41:27.360 --> 41:28.680
It's just hilarious.

517
41:40.080 --> 41:40.790
Uncle,

518
41:42.500 --> 41:45.050
you should be with the parents.

519
41:45.870 --> 41:47.270
You don't need to follow me.

520
41:48.720 --> 41:50.920
Once we reach an area with reception,

521
41:51.400 --> 41:53.850
call Kachen and tell him where I am.

522
41:56.190 --> 41:56.810
Sure.

523
42:04.520 --> 42:05.580
That must be his van.

524
42:10.440 --> 42:12.600
[KJ 1726 Ubon Ratchathani]

525
42:22.010 --> 42:23.460
Oh, Master! Hello.

526
42:23.490 --> 42:24.210
Hello.

527
42:25.000 --> 42:26.260
Are you Inspector Wichian?

528
42:26.280 --> 42:27.350
Yes, that's right.

529
42:29.720 --> 42:31.200
What's the situation?

530
42:31.970 --> 42:34.600
Well, the last lead that we found

531
42:34.620 --> 42:35.890
is this vehicle right here.

532
42:36.820 --> 42:38.730
It was left abandoned here.

533
42:39.440 --> 42:40.910
The car itself

534
42:41.000 --> 42:43.320
doesn't show any signs of a collision or damage.

535
42:43.380 --> 42:46.610
However, judging by the tire marks,

536
42:46.810 --> 42:48.560
we can reasonably deduce

537
42:48.590 --> 42:52.250
that the driver must have swerved to avoid something.

538
42:53.630 --> 42:54.850
And take a look here.

539
42:55.910 --> 42:56.800
Footprints.

540
42:57.970 --> 43:00.840
It looks as though they were all fleeing from someone

541
43:00.910 --> 43:02.260
or something.

542
43:02.820 --> 43:04.650
Has a search team gone in after them yet?

543
43:04.670 --> 43:07.800
Well, that's actually a major issue in itself.

544
43:08.080 --> 43:08.880
I mean...

545
43:09.370 --> 43:10.170
Ow!

546
43:11.620 --> 43:12.420
See?

547
43:13.180 --> 43:14.080
What's the status?

548
43:14.220 --> 43:14.980
Inspector,

549
43:15.280 --> 43:17.230
we didn't go far, but somehow we ended up here again.

550
43:18.800 --> 43:19.780
Again.

551
43:43.800 --> 43:44.810
Hurry, Nop!

552
43:46.100 --> 43:47.290
- Wait, Kao! - What?

553
43:47.320 --> 43:48.040
Come here!

554
43:48.690 --> 43:50.190
We're right back where we started.

555
43:51.460 --> 43:52.140
Shit!

556
43:52.380 --> 43:53.600
Are we just gonna stop and let them get us?

557
43:53.620 --> 43:54.500
Keep moving!

558
43:54.540 --> 43:55.150
We can't do that.

559
43:55.170 --> 43:56.150
We have to go back,

560
43:56.180 --> 43:57.040
or Max won't make it!

561
43:57.070 --> 43:58.320
What the hell can we do if we go back?

562
43:58.350 --> 44:00.410
They're freaking ghosts. Let's just get help!

563
44:00.430 --> 44:01.670
You're not gonna help our friend?

564
44:01.690 --> 44:03.720
How the hell can we? We'll all end up dead!

565
44:03.740 --> 44:05.110
Even if we run, we'll just end up back here.

566
44:05.140 --> 44:06.370
- God! - What's the point of running?

567
44:06.400 --> 44:08.190
- What the fuck is your problem? - If you wanna go, then go.

568
44:08.210 --> 44:09.930
I'm going back to help my friend.

569
44:19.290 --> 44:20.150
Shit...

570
44:37.480 --> 44:39.010
- Which way do we go? - Nop!

571
44:40.700 --> 44:42.550
- Don't come closer! - Don't you dare!

572
44:49.440 --> 44:52.810
Om, may success be granted. May divine blessings be revealed.

573
44:52.830 --> 44:55.720
I call upon Ganesha in the forms of Phra Phinek and Phra Phinai,

574
44:55.750 --> 44:58.150
Shiva, Vishnu,

575
44:58.170 --> 44:59.940
- Brahma, the Lord of Wind, - Shit, what's going on?

576
44:59.970 --> 45:01.800
- the Lords of Water and Fire, - Shit!

577
45:01.830 --> 45:04.130
- and Goddess Uma Bhogavati. - Nop, run!

578
45:04.150 --> 45:07.050
- Move! - By whose divine decree,

579
45:09.220 --> 45:11.550
I hold the power to unseal heaven and earth,

580
45:11.700 --> 45:14.090
the seas and mighty oceans,

581
45:14.110 --> 45:17.480
the mountains and soaring peaks,

582
45:17.560 --> 45:20.600
and the rivers and flowing streams.

583
45:42.400 --> 45:43.770
Guardian spirits of the forest,

584
45:44.680 --> 45:47.020
do you know where everyone is?

585
45:47.620 --> 45:51.110
Will you make a promise to me first?

586
45:52.740 --> 45:54.010
What do you ask of me?

587
45:54.870 --> 45:58.390
Perform an ordination ceremony for this forest.

588
45:59.190 --> 46:02.160
Cleanse this land and restore its purity.

589
46:12.440 --> 46:13.850
I give you my vow.

590
46:14.290 --> 46:17.910
Those kids are being hunted by malicious spirits

591
46:17.950 --> 46:21.570
that do not belong to this forest.

592
46:22.310 --> 46:26.630
They are merely thralls of a sorcerer,

593
46:26.850 --> 46:28.810
conjured solely to hunt them down.

594
46:30.810 --> 46:32.730
There isn't much time left.

595
46:33.110 --> 46:36.070
You, too, must tread carefully.

596
46:43.200 --> 46:44.190
Master,

597
46:45.880 --> 46:47.130
is something wrong?

598
46:51.100 --> 46:52.630
A sorcerer

599
46:53.590 --> 46:55.280
has sent spirits to hunt them down.

600
46:57.400 --> 46:59.650
Do you happen to know or have heard

601
46:59.670 --> 47:01.720
any stories about sorcerers around here?

602
47:04.250 --> 47:05.190
Well...

603
47:06.390 --> 47:08.520
there are a few sorcerers

604
47:08.540 --> 47:11.400
who work for powerful people.

605
47:12.450 --> 47:13.510
Which means...

606
47:13.960 --> 47:15.450
those kids

607
47:16.090 --> 47:19.550
might have gotten involved in something they shouldn't have.

608
47:23.710 --> 47:24.490
Well...

609
47:27.280 --> 47:28.280
Master,

610
47:28.490 --> 47:31.480
lives are on the line here.

611
47:32.750 --> 47:35.390
It's better to let us handle this.

612
47:38.330 --> 47:39.620
I've come this far.

613
47:41.460 --> 47:43.240
I have to save them no matter what.

614
47:58.490 --> 47:59.290
Jet,

615
47:59.850 --> 48:01.610
why did Kachen want to meet here?

616
48:04.130 --> 48:06.340
Surprise!

617
48:06.360 --> 48:08.910
[K-2101 Bangkok]

618
48:09.800 --> 48:10.490
What?

619
48:10.640 --> 48:11.460
What?

620
48:11.950 --> 48:13.780
Paran bought this car for you to use

621
48:13.800 --> 48:15.160
whenever you're in Bangkok.

622
48:16.450 --> 48:18.130
- This is my car? - Yeah.

623
48:18.150 --> 48:19.990
[K-2101 Bangkok]

624
48:25.060 --> 48:26.330
Is it really my car?

625
48:35.180 --> 48:36.760
Didn't he mention it to you?

626
48:42.760 --> 48:44.710
Congratulations, Khem.

627
48:47.020 --> 48:48.600
Want to take it for a maiden spin?

628
48:51.810 --> 48:53.010
I don't know how to drive.

629
48:54.160 --> 48:55.590
Could you drive for me?

630
48:56.970 --> 48:57.770
Sure.

631
49:00.350 --> 49:01.720
Hey, Kachen.

632
49:02.190 --> 49:03.630
Are you going back to Ubon Ratchathani soon?

633
49:03.910 --> 49:05.920
If you do, don't mention anything to my mom yet.

634
49:11.900 --> 49:13.410
Alright, got it.

635
49:13.540 --> 49:15.070
I'll stay out of it for now.

636
49:16.220 --> 49:17.800
Should I even bother going back?

637
49:18.010 --> 49:19.690
Even if I do, no one's there.

638
49:21.020 --> 49:22.000
Honestly, though,

639
49:22.420 --> 49:24.710
I thought Paran was gonna turn down work

640
49:26.000 --> 49:28.460
after the monk warned him about the misfortune coming his way.

641
49:33.850 --> 49:36.080
The monk? You mean Monk Kasem?

642
49:46.480 --> 49:47.410
Kachen.

643
49:47.980 --> 49:48.860
Yes?

644
49:48.930 --> 49:50.340
What did he say?

645
49:58.250 --> 49:59.440
Ouch, take it easy.

646
50:03.910 --> 50:05.350
Thank you so much, Master.

647
50:07.240 --> 50:08.200
I'll take my leave now.

648
50:11.560 --> 50:13.440
- Hello? It's done. - That auntie...

649
50:13.460 --> 50:14.870
Master is so handsome!

650
50:14.900 --> 50:17.420
The other guy didn't have a clue about anything.

651
50:21.240 --> 50:23.310
Guess I can't go celebrate with you anymore.

652
50:23.570 --> 50:26.110
I'll have to hit the town and find someone

653
50:26.130 --> 50:28.490
to soothe this sore waist of mine.

654
50:30.730 --> 50:32.120
Don't get too wild.

655
50:32.960 --> 50:34.600
You're not that young anymore.

656
50:36.530 --> 50:39.560
You would do well to heed his words, Kachen.

657
50:40.410 --> 50:42.590
Especially in the coming year.

658
50:44.760 --> 50:46.670
I see the shadow of ill fortune hanging over you.

659
50:47.670 --> 50:49.340
But not just you...

660
50:57.110 --> 50:59.040
The wedding day is drawing near now, isn't it?

661
51:01.180 --> 51:02.200
Yes, Monk Kasem.

662
51:02.770 --> 51:05.290
If you complete your pilgrimage early,

663
51:05.980 --> 51:07.280
please honor us with your presence.

664
51:09.600 --> 51:11.950
I may not be able to attend your wedding,

665
51:12.300 --> 51:13.460
but...

666
51:15.050 --> 51:17.470
I'd like to offer my blessings in advance.

667
51:17.670 --> 51:19.910
May you and Khem

668
51:20.450 --> 51:22.940
love and cherish each other for years to come.

669
51:24.820 --> 51:25.960
Also...

670
51:29.980 --> 51:32.220
take good care of yourself.

671
51:33.500 --> 51:35.550
Don't meddle in things

672
51:36.020 --> 51:38.340
that are not yours to deal with.

673
51:38.700 --> 51:40.450
This misfortune hanging over you

674
51:43.520 --> 51:45.430
is grave enough to cost you your life.

675
51:51.170 --> 51:53.420
He probably didn't want you to worry.

676
51:53.740 --> 51:54.920
I'm sorry

677
51:55.830 --> 51:57.340
that you had to find out from me.

678
52:11.320 --> 52:12.350
Hurry.

679
52:15.180 --> 52:16.120
Shit!

680
52:20.150 --> 52:21.150
What the hell is this?

681
52:30.930 --> 53:05.800
[Incanting]

682
53:05.830 --> 53:07.120
What should we do, Khem?

683
53:07.310 --> 53:08.910
We can still change our minds.

684
53:09.010 --> 53:10.460
Should we help Master instead?

685
53:10.590 --> 53:12.960
Yeah, I'll go with you anyway.

686
53:17.860 --> 53:19.350
There's nothing we can do to help.

687
53:19.490 --> 53:20.560
We should go to the set.

688
53:20.580 --> 53:22.570
They're waiting for our help, too.

689
53:22.720 --> 53:23.840
Are you really okay?

690
53:26.900 --> 53:27.640
Yeah.

691
53:28.850 --> 53:30.380
I trust Master.

692
53:38.890 --> 53:47.310
[Incanting]

693
54:19.480 --> 54:21.200
Please grant me the chance

694
54:22.460 --> 54:25.560
to return to my beloved.

695
55:25.940 --> 55:27.140
I've had this strange feeling

696
55:27.170 --> 55:29.190
ever since we got here.

697
55:30.610 --> 55:33.750
The life force is being concealed by numerous spirits.

698
55:33.780 --> 55:34.900
Master...

699
55:35.640 --> 55:36.740
I feel like he's...

700
55:36.770 --> 55:37.590
Master!

701
55:39.060 --> 55:40.180
I promised you

702
55:40.700 --> 55:42.210
I'd make it back alive.

703
55:42.990 --> 55:44.980
May the merit you have earned

704
55:45.160 --> 55:47.530
guide you to a better realm,

705
55:47.710 --> 55:49.610
and may you leave this world free of all worries.

706
55:52.270 --> 55:55.420
♪ We're soulmates, together we'll stay (Together we'll stay) ♪

707
55:55.450 --> 55:58.640
♪ Right by each other's side till our dying day (Till our dying day) ♪

708
55:58.670 --> 56:04.920
♪ Our love will never die or wither away ♪

709
56:04.950 --> 56:08.240
♪ Life may not go our way, (Go our way) ♪

710
56:08.270 --> 56:11.430
♪ And the world can be cruel some days, ♪

711
56:11.460 --> 56:18.660
♪ But we'll hold each other till the end of days ♪

712
56:19.040 --> 56:22.100
[The UNCUT version of Khemjira Forever]

713
56:22.130 --> 56:24.270
[is exclusively available

714
56:41.420 --> 56:50.030
♪ Till the end of days ♪
